  "details": "Button to alert friends you're in there world.\n\n(Free Idea)\nThe worlds are just getting bigger and more intricate and a few times I literally just could not find my friend. I came up with a solution to the problem.\n\n https://clips.twitch.tv/AgileIronicGiraffeStoneLightning\n\nI think it should be easier than that tho. Something to alert them or ask for a teleport or something like that would be really helpful.\n\n(Free extra idea on the house)\nAlso maybe add a keyboard that allows vr users to type, And you can make the letters pop up over that person's head. I personally don't actually like this idea because I quite enjoy mutes and I think it might get too cluttered on screen.\n\n(Free story on the house)\nI just saw I could add a picture, and so I am going to add a picture and a story along with it. I was playing monopoly and I was feeling pretty good that day. I was the leader of a group of men that would go on to win the game with me out of commision, I was sitting there waiting for my turn to roll the dice and BAM I was summoned just as the prophecy told, so I stood up there and wound and wound up my arm and with a mighty roar I yeeted that bitch out of the fucking stratosphere and along came my mighty controller. R.I.P my friend, you will be missed.\n\nhttps://clips.twitch.tv/SpikyAgileToadThisIsSparta",
